    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prol.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAs">V As</ref> Prol.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Æðelstan cyng cyþ, þæt ic hæbbe geashod, þæt ure frið is wyrs gehealden ðonne me lyste, oþþe hit æt Greatanlea gecweden wære; ⁊ mina witan secgað, þæt ic hit to lange forboren hæbbe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">I, King Æthelstan, declare that I have learned that the public peace has not been kept to the extent, either of my wishes, or of the provisions laid down at Grately. And my councillors say that I have suffered this too long.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ic Æthelstan cyng cyþ, þæt ic hæbbe geacsod, þæt ure fryþ is wyrs gehealden, ðonne me lyst, oþþe hit æt Greatanlæge gecwæden wære; ⁊ mine witan secgaþ, þæt ic hit to long forboren hæbbe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
